{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01003",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.98,
      "end_seconds": 3.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Lovely to meet you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.67,
      "end_seconds": 9.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.79,
      "end_seconds": 18.14,
      "duration_seconds": 6.35,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got burning when I pass urine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.96,
      "end_seconds": 21.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.46,
      "end_seconds": 24.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "It's been three days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.89,
      "end_seconds": 29.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Alright, how frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.55,
      "end_seconds": 66.11,
      "duration_seconds": 35.56,
      "text": "It's a couple of times a week. As for sudden urgent need to go, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. Oh, and a dull ache above the pubic bone. Had that since Monday. About dull ache above the pubic bone, I'd call it mild. It happens once or twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.31,
      "end_seconds": 74.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "And what about loin pain or new partner?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.09,
      "end_seconds": 81.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "I haven't had loin pain or new partner, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.86,
      "end_seconds": 85.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "a few quick ones: vomiting or vaginal discharge?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.89,
      "end_seconds": 92.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.8,
      "end_seconds": 95.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "And fever, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.47,
      "end_seconds": 99.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "No, no fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.01,
      "end_seconds": 105.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "Have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.25,
      "end_seconds": 107.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Nothing odd there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.88,
      "end_seconds": 112.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Okay, what operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.07,
      "end_seconds": 123.81,
      "duration_seconds": 9.74,
      "text": "Yes, I had a bunion operation, six years ago. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.64,
      "end_seconds": 137.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.32,
      "end_seconds": 142.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "No, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.72,
      "end_seconds": 147.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.69,
      "end_seconds": 151.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Gliclazide, 80 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 152.24,
      "end_seconds": 156.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 160 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.62,
      "end_seconds": 161.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Right. Do you happen to have the current prescription here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.67,
      "end_seconds": 175.98,
      "duration_seconds": 13.31,
      "text": "No, uh, I left it at home. It's cranberry juice, every day. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.07,
      "end_seconds": 195.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.9,
      "end_seconds": 200.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "I've had diabetes for five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.91,
      "end_seconds": 206.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.62,
      "end_seconds": 227.91,
      "duration_seconds": 20.29,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette. I'll have a glass of wine with dinner. I hardly move around during the day. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day. I grab fast food at lunch most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 233.11,
      "end_seconds": 243.04,
      "duration_seconds": 9.93,
      "text": "okay, so the vitals from earlier blood pressure 128 over 74, oxygen saturation is 97 percent, heart rate 67. Temperature 36.5."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.35,
      "end_seconds": 245.31,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "okay, noted"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.51,
      "end_seconds": 249.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Now I'm gonna do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.25,
      "end_seconds": 255.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "sure thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.24,
      "end_seconds": 259.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.82,
      "end_seconds": 277.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft with mild tenderness low down and no pain in the loins."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.36,
      "end_seconds": 282.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Right, all finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.57,
      "end_seconds": 304.57,
      "duration_seconds": 10.0,
      "text": "Let me tell you where I've got to. This is probably a lower urinary tract infection. A kidney infection is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.06,
      "end_seconds": 309.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.74,
      "end_seconds": 337.75,
      "duration_seconds": 27.01,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a lower urinary tract infection is my leading thought, not anything worse. I want a urine test done, that's for dysuria. I'd like to arrange a urine culture for recurrent urinary infection. For this, nitrofurantoin, 100 milligrams, twice a day, for three days. It's for urinary infection. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.65,
      "end_seconds": 362.45,
      "duration_seconds": 23.8,
      "text": "drink plenty of water and don't hold on when you need to go and please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose do get help quickly if you get fever, loin pain or vomiting so, have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 363.61,
      "end_seconds": 366.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "great, thank you for your help"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.09,
      "end_seconds": 368.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}